    "falsified_words": "Either forecast is proven wrong if its middle outcome lands on the other side of zero.",
    "persist": "When a stock drops hard on its own while the market is flat or up, the drop tends to stick: the middle such stock is at least 0.5 points behind the market 20 trading days later.",
